                            </td>
                            <td class="px-6 py-4">
                                <div class="font-bold text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Personal Training</div>
                                <div class="text-xs text-zinc-400 dark:text-zinc-500 mt-0.5">PT Reservation</div>
                            </td>
                            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300">Ali Ahmed</td>
                            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300 whitespace-nowrap">21 May 2025</td>
                            <td class="px-6 py-4 font-mono text-xs text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300 whitespace-nowrap">10:00 AM</td>
                            <td class="px-6 py-4">
